{73}{Did Sharpe hate Wrath enough to kill him?}{}{5}{}{82}{ }
{82}{It was the other way around, actually. I think Wrath became a bit unbalanced. Of course, we all know that elves do not have it in them to wantonly murder each other over things like jealousy.}{It was the other way around, actually. I think Wrath became a bit unbalanced. Of course, we all know that elves do not have it in them to wantonly murder each other over things like jealousy.}{}{}{}{ }
