{234}{So, Wrath was evil...and Sharpe killed him to protect you!}{}{5}{lf25 0}{500}{lf25 1 }
{240}{Wrath had a black heart! I can't believe we were ever friends with him. He turned when he found out I didn't love him.}{Wrath had a black heart! I can't believe we were ever friends with him. He turned when he found out I didn't love him.}{}{}{}{ }
