{250}{He was the one who suggested I live with HIM. I liked the idea, strange as it may be, but I never felt anything but friendship towards Wrath. Sharpe was the one I loved.}{He was the one who suggested I live with HIM. I liked the idea, strange as it may be, but I never felt anything but friendship towards Wrath. Sharpe was the one I loved.}{}{}{}{ }
{251}{So what happened then?}{}{5}{}{260}{ }
