{253}{Why was that such a strange idea?}{}{5}{ra3}{350}{ }
{260}{That's when Wrath became a truly miserable person. He would come around when Sharpe wasn't here and try to convince me that either I should love him, or that Sharpe was somehow not worthy of me. When I finally told him to stop bothering me is when he began threatening me.}{That's when Wrath became a truly miserable person. He would come around when Sharpe wasn't here and try to convince me that either I should love him, or that Sharpe was somehow not worthy of me. When I finally told him to stop bothering me is when he began threatening me.}{}{}{}{ }
{262}{Wait a minute - he threatened you?}{}{5}{}{270}{ }
{270}{And the threats became progressively worse. He threatened to kill Sharpe at one point. The last thing he ever said to me was that he wouldn't let Sharpe have me if he couldn't.}{And the threats became progressively worse. He threatened to kill Sharpe at one point. The last thing he ever said to me was that he wouldn't let Sharpe have me if he couldn't.}{}{}{}{ }
{271}{I see. I think he killed himself and framed Sharpe.}{}{13}{}{310}{gf2166 1, xp10 }
