{280}{That was a hundred years ago, he hadn't even spoken to us since then. I know that us elves are a patient people, but I can't believe he was bitter all that time.}{That was a hundred years ago, he hadn't even spoken to us since then. I know that us elves are a patient people, but I can't believe he was bitter all that time.}{}{}{}{ }
{281}{So what you're saying is that Sharpe had no reason to kill Wrath?}{}{5}{}{290}{ }
