{291}{If Wrath were to kill him, though, you would have hated him.}{}{5}{}{300}{ }
{300}{But if he could get Sharpe to kill him, the whole village, including me, would turn on Sharpe.}{But if he could get Sharpe to kill him, the whole village, including me, would turn on Sharpe.}{}{}{}{ }
{302}{Or if he killed himself and framed Sharpe.}{}{5}{}{310}{ }
{310}{[A look of recognition crosses her face.] By the gods! That bastard did it! I can not believe he could be that bitter - to kill himself! What a fool!}{[A look of recognition crosses her face.] By the gods! That bastard did it! I can not believe he could be that bitter - to kill himself! What a fool!}{}{}{}{gf2166 1, xp10 }
